1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,736
这是一行代码，是哈佛的一位授课老师在课堂上现场 commit 的
Here is a line of code that a Harvard instructor committed, live, in class.

2
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:10,624
一个点到原点的距离，是 x 的平方加 y 的平方，再开平方
The distance from a point to the origin is the square root of x squared plus y squared.

3
00:00:10,944 --> 00:00:13,419
这一行算的却是它的两倍再开平方
This line takes the square root of twice that.

4
00:00:13,739 --> 00:00:16,085
什么都没崩溃；应用照常启动了
Nothing crashed; the app started fine.

5
00:00:16,405 --> 00:00:18,027
只是答案错了
The answer was just wrong.

6
00:00:18,267 --> 00:00:19,867
你输入 git commit
You type git commit.

7
00:00:19,952 --> 00:00:24,731
在这个 commit 生成之前，谁有权说不，它们又到底能抓到什么？
Before that commit exists, who gets to say no, and what can they actually catch?

8
00:00:25,051 --> 00:00:28,038
课上给能说不的东西起了个名字
The lecture has a word for whoever can say no:

9
00:00:28,038 --> 00:00:30,896
门禁，也就是任何会失败、能拦住你的东西
a gate, anything that can fail and stop you.

10
00:00:31,216 --> 00:00:34,992
今天我们就在你的电脑上搭一个门禁，看着它拒绝一次 commit
Today we build one on your machine, and watch it refuse a commit.

11
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:41,308
先退一步看：在一个机器学习系统里，模型只是一大张格子里的几块
Step back once: in a machine learning system, the model is a few tiles in a big grid;

12
00:00:41,308 --> 00:00:42,908
其余都是工程
the rest is engineering.

13
00:00:43,221 --> 00:00:44,865
今天讲的就是这些工程
Today is that engineering:

14
00:00:44,865 --> 00:00:48,405
测试、格式化工具、linter，还有运行它们的 hook
tests, formatters, linters, and the hook that runs them.

15
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:53,213
想跟着做，你需要自己 clone 一份 cheese-app-ci-cd
To follow along you need your own clone of cheese-app-ci-cd,

16
00:00:53,213 --> 00:00:56,863
开着 Docker Desktop，还要有 Python 3.9 及以上
Docker Desktop running, and Python 3.9 or newer.

17
00:00:57,183 --> 00:00:59,453
不用云，不用凭据，没有账单
No cloud, no credentials, no bill:

18
00:00:59,453 --> 00:01:02,858
一切都在你的笔记本上跑，这正是重点
everything runs on your laptop, which is the point.

19
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:07,270
左上角的进度条显示我们在 README 的哪一步
The tracker in the top left shows which README step we are on;

20
00:01:07,270 --> 00:01:10,162
今天一共 6 段：4 段来自 cheese 的 README
6 sections today: 4 from the cheese README,

21
00:01:10,162 --> 00:01:12,785
1 段是客座讲座，1 段是清理
1 for the guest lecture, 1 for cleanup.

22
00:01:13,105 --> 00:01:16,881
看到黄色的 your turn 标签，就暂停，自己跑这条命令
When the yellow your-turn tag appears, pause and run the command.

23
00:01:17,201 --> 00:01:20,508
灰色的 extra 标签表示这个检查 README 里没有
A gray extra tag marks a check not in the README.

24
00:01:20,828 --> 00:01:23,836
每条命令都在学习指南里，链接在下方
Every command is in the study guide, linked below.

25
00:01:24,883 --> 00:01:26,632
这个 bug 是真实的历史
The bug is real history.

26
00:01:26,952 --> 00:01:29,455
这个 repo 自己的 log 讲了整个故事
This repo's own log tells the story:

27
00:01:29,455 --> 00:01:33,416
先是故意加回来的乱代码，然后是一次崩溃，再是一次修复
messy code re-added on purpose, then a crash, then a fix.

28
00:01:33,736 --> 00:01:36,546
接着课堂演示把那个错的平方根混了进去
Then the class demo slipped the wrong square root in,

29
00:01:36,546 --> 00:01:38,146
后来又被 revert 拿掉了
and the revert took it out.

30
00:01:38,366 --> 00:01:39,866
额外跑一下 git log
An extra git log

31
00:01:39,866 --> 00:01:44,680
确认 clone 下来的正是最后那个 commit，2025 年 11 月的
confirms the clone sits at that last commit, from November 2025.

32
00:01:44,916 --> 00:01:46,943
想象一个点：x 是 3，y 是 4
Picture the point (3, 4).

33
00:01:47,263 --> 00:01:51,636
它到原点的真实距离是 5，也就是这个圆的半径
Its true distance from the origin is 5, the radius of this circle.

34
00:01:51,956 --> 00:01:58,804
有 bug 的那一行返回 50 的平方根，大约 7.07：冲出了这个圆
The buggy line returns the square root of 50, about 7.07: it overshoots the circle.

35
00:01:59,124 --> 00:02:02,388
没崩溃，没报错，只有一个错的数字
No crash, no error message, only a wrong number.

36
00:02:02,633 --> 00:02:05,577
有一个现成的测试早就知道正确答案
One existing test already knew the right answer.

37
00:02:05,897 --> 00:02:09,136
它让应用算 x 是 3、y 是 4 的距离
It asks the app for the distance of (3, 4) and insists on exactly 5.0.

38
00:02:09,136 --> 00:02:11,764
并且坚持结果必须正好是 5.0
It asks the app for the distance of (3, 4) and insists on exactly 5.0.

39
00:02:12,084 --> 00:02:14,583
测试就是可执行的规格说明
A test is an executable specification,

40
00:02:14,583 --> 00:02:18,462
这个测试本来会在任何人看到演示之前就说不
and this one would have said no before anyone saw the demo.

41
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:22,284
测试失败时，有两个嫌疑人：代码和测试
When a test fails, there are two suspects, the code and the test.

42
00:02:22,604 --> 00:02:26,209
课上的规则是：先相信测试，去改代码
The lecture's rule: first believe the test, and fix the code.

43
00:02:26,529 --> 00:02:31,201
为了迁就 bug 去改测试，规格说明就变成了日记
Rewriting the test to match a bug turns your specification into a diary.

44
00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:33,450
什么值得测试？
What is worth testing?

45
00:02:33,514 --> 00:02:38,271
课上把输入分进三个托盘：正常、边缘和非法
The lecture sorts inputs into three trays: normal, edge, and invalid.

46
00:02:38,591 --> 00:02:42,408
对这里的 power 函数来说，2 的 3 次方是正常输入
For the power function here, 2 to the power 3 is normal;

47
00:02:42,408 --> 00:02:45,951
指数为零、无穷大和非数值都是边缘情况
zero exponents, infinity and not a number are edges.

48
00:02:46,271 --> 00:02:50,361
至于非法输入，pytest.raises 把测试反过来
And for invalid input, pytest.raises inverts the test:

49
00:02:50,361 --> 00:02:54,527
只有对字符串调用 power 时抛出 TypeError，测试才通过
it passes only if power on a string raises a TypeError.

50
00:02:55,567 --> 00:02:58,081
现在用一个请求来讲课上的词汇
Now the lecture's vocabulary,

51
00:02:58,081 --> 00:03:02,330
GET euclidean distance，x 是 3，y 是 4
on one request: GET /euclidean_distance/?x=3&y=4.

52
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:06,938
在处理函数里，求 x 的平方是一次调用：power，参数是 3 和 2
Inside the handler, squaring x is one call, power(3, 2).

53
00:03:07,258 --> 00:03:11,524
单元测试完全绕开应用，只单独调用这一个函数
A unit test skips the app entirely and calls that one function alone.

54
00:03:11,844 --> 00:03:14,532
它很快，而且失败时你知道该去哪儿找
It is fast, and when it fails you know where to look.

55
00:03:14,767 --> 00:03:17,775
集成测试把我们自己的几个部分连起来
An integration test wires several of our parts.

56
00:03:18,095 --> 00:03:22,645
测试客户端把请求直接交给 FastAPI 应用
The test client hands the request straight to the FastAPI app,

57
00:03:22,645 --> 00:03:26,974
在同一个进程里：路由、校验、处理函数和 power 全都跑了
in process: routing, validation, handler and power all run,

58
00:03:26,974 --> 00:03:29,103
但没有服务器，也没有网络
but no server and no network.

59
00:03:29,423 --> 00:03:33,135
录制时，这里有 10 个这样的测试，不到一秒就跑完
Ten of those run here in under a second, at the time of recording.

60
00:03:33,384 --> 00:03:36,947
系统测试把运行中的程序当成一个黑盒
A system test treats the running program as a black box.

61
00:03:37,267 --> 00:03:42,581
请求离开测试，穿过一根真实的网线到达 port 9000
The request leaves the test, crosses a real network wire to port 9000,

62
00:03:42,581 --> 00:03:44,328
再以 JSON 的形式回来
and comes back as JSON.

63
00:03:44,648 --> 00:03:48,296
它是最诚实的测试，也是最慢、最脆弱的
It is the most honest test, and the slowest and most fragile.

64
00:03:48,817 --> 00:03:51,265
叠起来，就是测试金字塔
Stacked, that is the testing pyramid:

65
00:03:51,265 --> 00:03:55,964
底层是大量便宜的单元测试，顶上是少量昂贵的系统测试
many cheap unit tests at the bottom, few expensive system tests on top.

66
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:58,973
课上还给了一个更锐利的视角：一条边界
The lecture adds a sharper lens: a border.

67
00:03:59,293 --> 00:04:02,707
一个测试是 hermetic 的，指的是只有你的代码能让它失败
A test is hermetic when only your code can make it fail.

68
00:04:03,027 --> 00:04:06,525
单元测试和集成测试都在这条边界之内
Unit and integration tests live inside that border.

69
00:04:06,845 --> 00:04:08,553
系统测试跨过了它
The system test crosses it:

70
00:04:08,553 --> 00:04:12,350
一台运行中的服务器可能会挂掉，原因却不是你的 bug
a live server can be down for reasons that are not your bug.

71
00:04:12,584 --> 00:04:15,427
还有两类测试只占淡淡的两行
Two more kinds get faint rows: a smoke test,

72
00:04:15,427 --> 00:04:21,373
冒烟测试，只问它有没有响应；还有验收测试，这个项目暂时还没有
which only asks whether it answers, and acceptance tests, which this project lacks, for now.

73
00:04:21,693 --> 00:04:23,178
关于类型说一句
One note about kinds:

74
00:04:23,178 --> 00:04:27,069
测试属于哪一类，看的是实际运行了什么，而不是它放在哪个目录
a test's kind is named by what runs, not by its folder.

75
00:04:27,389 --> 00:04:31,933
这个 repo 的系统测试文件管自己叫集成测试
This repo's system test file calls itself integration tests,

76
00:04:31,933 --> 00:04:34,811
它的 pytest 配置还定义了一些 marker
and its pytest config defines markers,

77
00:04:34,811 --> 00:04:40,189
也就是用来挑选测试的记号，却没人用；marker 会在第二部分回来
labels for selecting tests, that nobody uses; markers return in part 2.

78
00:04:40,434 --> 00:04:43,357
最后一张图：一张空表，四列
Last picture: an empty table, four columns.

79
00:04:43,677 --> 00:04:47,879
检查什么，怎么检查，用哪条命令，以及是不是每次 commit 都跑
What is checked, how, with which command, and does it run on every commit.

80
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,799
第一部分会把它填满
Part 1 fills it in.

81
00:04:50,650 --> 00:04:52,029
该动手敲了
Time to type.

82
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:55,760
README 只说从你的仓库 clone 或下载
The README says clone or download from your repository,

83
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:58,437
没给地址，所以这里给出 repo 的地址
without an address, so here is the repo.

84
00:04:58,757 --> 00:05:01,871
先 clone，再 cd 进 cheese-app-ci-cd
Clone it, then cd into cheese-app-ci-cd.

85
00:05:02,191 --> 00:05:03,683
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

86
00:05:03,733 --> 00:05:07,573
额外看一圈，README 里没有这一步：ls -la
An extra look around, not in the README: ls -la.

87
00:05:07,893 --> 00:05:11,549
今天的东西全在这儿：tests 下面的三个
Everything today is here: three test folders under tests,

88
00:05:11,549 --> 00:05:14,327
测试目录、一个 pytest 配置、一个 pre-commit 配置
a pytest config, a pre-commit config,

89
00:05:14,327 --> 00:05:17,749
还有把它们打包进一个 image 的 Dockerfile
and the Dockerfile that bakes them into one image.

90
00:05:17,983 --> 00:05:22,164
现在是 README 的第一条命令：sh docker-shell.sh
Now the README's first command: sh docker-shell.sh.

91
00:05:22,484 --> 00:05:26,018
它会构建 image，录制时大约要一分钟
It builds the image, about a minute at the time of recording,

92
00:05:26,018 --> 00:05:28,799
然后把你放进 container 里的一个 shell
and drops you into a shell inside the container.

93
00:05:29,119 --> 00:05:30,541
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

94
00:05:30,591 --> 00:05:33,585
看一下提示符：用户是 app，不是 root
Read the prompt: the user is app, not root,

95
00:05:33,585 --> 00:05:35,605
而且 ID 每次运行都会变
and the ID changes every run.

96
00:05:37,050 --> 00:05:41,175
在里面启动服务器：uvicorn api.service:app
Inside, start the server: uvicorn

97
00:05:41,175 --> 00:05:47,674
host 是 0.0.0.0，port 是 9000，加上 --reload
api.service:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 9000 --reload.

98
00:05:47,994 --> 00:05:50,886
等它显示 Application startup complete
When it says Application startup complete,

99
00:05:50,886 --> 00:05:53,679
就在浏览器里打开 README 的三个 URL
open the three README URLs in your browser;

100
00:05:53,679 --> 00:05:55,219
暂停一下，照着做
pause and do it.

101
00:05:55,269 --> 00:05:58,186
这里用三次 curl 代替浏览器
Here three curl calls stand in for the browser:

102
00:05:58,186 --> 00:06:00,730
欢迎信息、health，还有距离的结果
welcome, health, and the distance answer.

103
00:06:01,767 --> 00:06:06,290
有一个小疏漏：README 说这个接口返回 5.0
One small gap: the README says this endpoint returns 5.0.

104
00:06:06,610 --> 00:06:09,111
实际上它返回的是一个 JSON 对象
Really it returns a JSON object

105
00:06:09,111 --> 00:06:12,903
其中 distance 字段是 5.0，代码里写得很清楚
whose distance field is 5.0, as the code shows.

106
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:17,614
用 Ctrl-C 停掉服务器，再输入 exit
Stop the server with Ctrl-C, then type exit.

107
00:06:17,934 --> 00:06:23,185
因为这个 shell 脚本用了 --rm，什么都不会留下
Because the shell script used --rm, nothing is left behind;

108
00:06:23,185 --> 00:06:26,211
额外跑一下 docker ps -a 就能确认
an extra docker ps -a confirms it.

109
00:06:26,531 --> 00:06:31,331
先提醒一句，很快就会用上：你的文件没有挂载进这个 container
One warning that pays off soon: your files are not mounted into this container.

110
00:06:31,651 --> 00:06:35,318
参数 --reload 盯着的是打包进 image 的那份副本
The --reload flag watches the copy baked into the image,

111
00:06:35,318 --> 00:06:39,246
所以你在笔记本上改了什么，在重新构建之前都不起作用
so an edit on your laptop changes nothing until you rebuild.

112
00:06:40,283 --> 00:06:44,422
Part 2 用两个工具找代码质量问题，这两个可别搞混
Part 2 hunts for quality issues with two tools not to confuse.

113
00:06:44,742 --> 00:06:49,307
格式化工具把代码改写成统一的排版，从不改变行为
A formatter rewrites code into one layout and never changes behavior.

114
00:06:49,627 --> 00:06:51,190
而 linter 只负责报告
A linter only reports:

115
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:54,811
风格问题、可能的 bug、需要人来处理的地方
style issues, likely bugs, things needing a person.

116
00:06:55,131 --> 00:06:56,859
先格式化，再 lint
Format first, then lint.

117
00:06:57,716 --> 00:07:01,385
先构建 image：cheese-app-api:local
First build the image, cheese-app-api:local.

118
00:07:01,705 --> 00:07:03,079
每一步都显示 CACHED
Every step says CACHED:

119
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:05,887
那个 shell 脚本已经构建过这个 Dockerfile 了
the shell script already built this Dockerfile.

120
00:07:06,207 --> 00:07:07,550
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

121
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,162
现在在 image 里跑 linter
Now the linter,

122
00:07:09,162 --> 00:07:14,576
flake8，--max-line-length 设成 120，检查 api 目录
inside the image: flake8 --max-line-length=120 api/.

123
00:07:14,896 --> 00:07:16,318
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

124
00:07:16,368 --> 00:07:20,451
在 utils.py 里发现两个问题，逗号后面少了空格
Two findings in utils.py, a missing space after a comma,

125
00:07:20,451 --> 00:07:23,877
还有空行太多：都是故意留下的乱代码
and too many blank lines: mess left on purpose.

126
00:07:24,116 --> 00:07:26,434
然后是 black，用 --check 和 --diff 模式
Then black, in --check --diff mode.

127
00:07:26,484 --> 00:07:27,906
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

128
00:07:27,956 --> 00:07:31,156
它说有 2 个文件会被重新格式化，而不是一个
It reports 2 files would be reformatted, not one.

129
00:07:31,476 --> 00:07:37,138
这条命令没给 black 指定宽度，所以它退回默认的 88
This command gives black no width, so it falls back to its default of 88

130
00:07:37,138 --> 00:07:40,991
把 service.py 里一行 95 个字符的代码也折了
and also folds a 95 character line in service.py.

131
00:07:41,233 --> 00:07:42,591
看好这个陷阱
Watch the trap.

132
00:07:42,641 --> 00:07:46,580
宽度 88 时，black 把那一行折成三行
At width 88, black folds that line into three;

133
00:07:46,580 --> 00:07:48,806
宽度 120 时，又展开回一行
at 120, it unfolds to one.

134
00:07:49,126 --> 00:07:51,690
这里的 hook 和 CI 都用 120
The hook and CI here both use 120,

135
00:07:51,690 --> 00:07:54,857
但 README 里有几条命令没给宽度
but several README commands pass no width,

136
00:07:54,857 --> 00:07:57,873
于是同一个文件得到不同的结论
so the same file gets different answers.

137
00:07:58,193 --> 00:08:01,820
要么每次都传 120，要么在配置里一次写好
Always pass 120, or set it once in config.

138
00:08:07,066 --> 00:08:11,219
Option B 在你的笔记本上跑同样的检查
Option B runs the same checks on your laptop:

139
00:08:11,219 --> 00:08:15,557
用 pip 在宿主机上装 black 和 flake8
install black and flake8 with pip, on the host,

140
00:08:15,557 --> 00:08:19,525
录制时分别是 26.10.1 和 7.4.1
26.10.1 and 7.4.1 at the time of recording.

141
00:08:19,845 --> 00:08:21,267
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

142
00:08:21,317 --> 00:08:25,115
如果 pip 拒绝，报 externally-managed-environment
If pip refuses with externally-managed-environment,

143
00:08:25,115 --> 00:08:26,827
Homebrew 的 Python 就会这样
as Homebrew Pythons do,

144
00:08:26,827 --> 00:08:30,327
那就用第 1 讲的任意一个虚拟环境，或者 pipx
use any lecture 1 virtual environment, or pipx;

145
00:08:30,327 --> 00:08:32,858
学习指南里有那一行命令
the study guide has the one-liner.

146
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,671
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

147
00:08:34,721 --> 00:08:37,900
本地的 flake8 用默认的 79
The local flake8, at its default of 79,

148
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:41,976
多报了第三个问题，就是那行 95 个字符的代码
adds a third finding, that same 95 character line;

149
00:08:41,976 --> 00:08:45,644
本地的 black 要改的还是那两个文件
local black wants the same two files changed.

150
00:08:46,916 --> 00:08:48,516
格式化工具能修好什么？
What can a formatter fix?

151
00:08:48,772 --> 00:08:52,166
在 repo 历史里那个乱糟糟的 service.py 上
On the messy service.py from the repo's history,

152
00:08:52,166 --> 00:08:56,550
black 几乎扫掉了所有问题，正好剩下 2 个
black sweeps away almost every finding, and exactly 2 survive:

153
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:58,050
一个没用到的 import
an unused import,

154
00:08:58,050 --> 00:09:03,620
格式化工具删不掉；还有一个带引号的长句子，black 不能改写它
which a formatter cannot delete, and a long quoted sentence black must not rewrite.

155
00:09:03,940 --> 00:09:05,839
课上是手动把这两个修好的
The class fixed both by hand.

156
00:09:07,883 --> 00:09:11,467
在成批跑测试之前，先认识一下找测试的那台机器
Before running tests in bulk, meet the machine that finds them.

157
00:09:11,787 --> 00:09:18,072
配置文件 pytest.ini 定下规则：文件名以 test 下划线开头
The config file pytest.ini sets the rules: files named test_*.py,

158
00:09:18,072 --> 00:09:22,326
类名以 Test 开头，函数名以 test 下划线开头
classes named Test*, functions named test_*.

159
00:09:22,646 --> 00:09:27,378
它还给每次运行加上一些选项，要记住的是 -ra
It also adds options to every run, and the one to remember is -ra,

160
00:09:27,378 --> 00:09:30,603
凡是没有干脆通过的，都会列进这份摘要
the summary of everything not plainly passed.

161
00:09:30,850 --> 00:09:33,745
看收集器扫过 tests 目录
Watch the collector sweep the tests folder:

162
00:09:33,745 --> 00:09:36,908
每个匹配的名字都亮起来，一共 26 个测试
every matching name lights up, 26 tests in all.

163
00:09:37,566 --> 00:09:39,166
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

164
00:09:39,230 --> 00:09:44,514
README 后面有一部分，往一个测试文件末尾追加一行 def broken
A later README part appends the line def broken(): assert False to a test file,

165
00:09:44,514 --> 00:09:46,419
内容是 assert False，想让构建失败
hoping to break the build.

166
00:09:46,739 --> 00:09:48,638
单元测试会变红吗？
Will the unit test run go red?

167
00:09:57,483 --> 00:10:01,600
不会。看收集器：追加的那个名字一直是暗的
No. Watch the collector: the appended name stays dark.

168
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,230
这个名字不匹配 test 下划线加星号
The name does not match test_*,

169
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:06,912
所以它从没被收集，也从没运行
so it is never collected, never run.

170
00:10:07,232 --> 00:10:10,624
想真的让构建失败，就把它叫作 test 下划线 broken
To really break the build, call it test_broken.

171
00:10:10,944 --> 00:10:13,590
按约定发现测试，是一把双刃剑
Discovery by convention cuts both ways.

172
00:10:13,833 --> 00:10:16,350
再用 30 秒讲 pytest 的三个动作
Three more pytest verbs in 30 seconds.

173
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:20,361
普通的 assert 会被改写，失败时两边的值都会显示出来
A plain assert is rewritten so a failure shows both values.

174
00:10:20,681 --> 00:10:24,308
对浮点数，pytest.approx 带着容差来比较
For floats, pytest.approx compares with a tolerance.

175
00:10:24,628 --> 00:10:29,320
而 pytest.raises 只有在代码块抛出指定的错误时才通过
And pytest.raises passes only when the block raises the named error:

176
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,390
就是前面那个非法输入的托盘
the invalid tray from earlier.

177
00:10:31,633 --> 00:10:35,302
课上还送了一个礼物，这个 repo 还没用上
One gift from the lecture that this repo does not use yet.

178
00:10:35,622 --> 00:10:40,166
集成测试把测试客户端只建一次，作为模块级的全局变量
The integration tests build their test client once, as a module global.

179
00:10:40,486 --> 00:10:42,108
用 fixture 会更好
A fixture would do it better.

180
00:10:42,428 --> 00:10:46,609
测试按名字要 client，pytest 负责建好并注入
A test asks for client by name, and pytest builds and injects it.

181
00:10:46,929 --> 00:10:51,473
有一个设置决定每个测试拿一个新的，还是整次运行共用一个
A setting says whether each test gets a fresh one or the whole run shares one.

182
00:10:51,793 --> 00:10:56,273
而 parametrize 把四份副本折成一个函数，带四组输入
And parametrize folds four copies into one function with four inputs.

183
00:10:58,517 --> 00:11:02,248
Part 3 在应用所在的地方跑测试，也就是 image 里面
Part 3 runs tests where the app lives, inside the image,

184
00:11:02,248 --> 00:11:04,780
有三条路：每个测试集一条 docker run
by three routes: docker run per suite,

185
00:11:04,780 --> 00:11:08,778
为系统测试起一个运行中的服务器，或者一个交互式 shell
a live server for the system tests, or an interactive shell.

186
00:11:09,098 --> 00:11:11,904
Dockerfile 复制 pyproject.toml
The Dockerfile copies pyproject.toml

187
00:11:11,904 --> 00:11:15,413
安装依赖，形成一个很厚的层
and installs the dependencies, one fat layer.

188
00:11:15,733 --> 00:11:19,131
接着四行薄薄的 COPY 把 api 代码、测试
Then four thin copy lines bake in the api code,

189
00:11:19,131 --> 00:11:22,602
pytest 配置和 entrypoint 打包进去
the tests, the pytest config and the entrypoint.

190
00:11:22,922 --> 00:11:25,169
这个 entrypoint 把 pytest 放进 PATH
The entrypoint puts pytest on PATH,

191
00:11:25,169 --> 00:11:29,472
它的 exec 那一行再把 container 交给你传进来的任何命令
and its exec line hands the container to whatever command you pass.

192
00:11:29,792 --> 00:11:31,555
靠的是 container 的退出码
The container's exit code

193
00:11:31,555 --> 00:11:34,165
docker run 才能让 CI 的一个步骤失败
is how docker run can fail a CI step.

194
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:40,163
再构建一次，全是缓存，然后跑单元测试：docker run --rm
Build again, all cached, then run the unit tests: docker run --rm,

195
00:11:40,163 --> 00:11:43,744
加上 image 名，再加 pytest tests/unit/：11 passed
the image, pytest tests/unit/: 11 passed.

196
00:11:44,064 --> 00:11:45,550
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

197
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:49,155
集成测试显示 10 passed, 1 warning
The integration suite says 10 passed, 1 warning;

198
00:11:49,155 --> 00:11:52,341
两个测试集一起跑，是 21 passed, 1 warning
both suites together, 21 passed, 1 warning.

199
00:11:52,661 --> 00:11:54,190
暂停一下，把它们都跑一遍
Pause and run them.

200
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:59,799
那个 1 warning 是录制时 pytest 9 的摘要行
The 1 warning is pytest 9's summary line counting a warning this config hides,

201
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:03,435
把这份配置隐藏掉的一个警告也算了进去：测试相同，结果也相同
at the time of recording: same tests, same results.

202
00:12:03,684 --> 00:12:07,972
现在跑覆盖率：单元测试，统计 api 这个包
Now the coverage run: unit tests, measuring the api package.

203
00:12:08,292 --> 00:12:09,714
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

204
00:12:09,764 --> 00:12:14,415
看 service.py：0%；单元测试从来没有 import 它
Look at service.py: 0 percent; the unit tests never import it.

205
00:12:14,735 --> 00:12:19,065
覆盖率是一份没人问过的代码行清单，而不是一个分数
Coverage is a list of lines nobody has asked about, not a score.

206
00:12:19,385 --> 00:12:20,750
先记住这一点
Hold that thought.

207
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:23,127
门禁表有了第一行
The gate table gets its first row:

208
00:12:23,127 --> 00:12:27,029
单元测试和集成测试，hermetic，一条 docker 命令
unit and integration tests, hermetic, one docker command.

209
00:12:27,349 --> 00:12:29,931
Option 2 先等等；下一段专门讲它
Option 2 waits; it gets the next scene.

210
00:12:30,251 --> 00:12:32,652
Option 3 是同样的事，换成交互式
Option 3 is the same interactively:

211
00:12:32,652 --> 00:12:36,907
再跑一次 docker-shell.sh，同样的 pytest 命令，同样的数字
docker-shell again, the same pytest commands, the same counts.

212
00:12:37,227 --> 00:12:38,227
有一个陷阱
One trap:

213
00:12:38,227 --> 00:12:43,129
HTML 报告生成在一个会被 --rm 删掉的 container 里
the HTML report lands inside a container that --rm deletes,

214
00:12:43,129 --> 00:12:44,779
一 exit 就没了
gone when you exit.

215
00:12:45,099 --> 00:12:46,870
优先用终端里的报告
Prefer the terminal report.

216
00:12:47,117 --> 00:12:51,031
这个 image 把开发工具当成运行时依赖一起发布
This image ships its dev tools as runtime dependencies,

217
00:12:51,031 --> 00:12:53,094
版本只有下限，没有 lock 文件
open ended pins, no lockfile;

218
00:12:53,094 --> 00:12:57,293
客座讲座则把它们放进依赖组，由一个 lock 文件锁住
the guest lecture keeps them in groups behind one lockfile.

219
00:12:57,613 --> 00:13:01,977
第一部分的那句提醒这时用上了：你在笔记本上改了 utils.py
And the part 1 warning pays off: edit utils.py on your laptop,

220
00:13:01,977 --> 00:13:05,357
这个 container 测的还是昨天的副本
and this container still tests yesterday's copy.

221
00:13:05,677 --> 00:13:07,576
要么重新构建，要么你测的就是过去
Rebuild, or you test the past.

222
00:13:10,117 --> 00:13:13,852
Option 2 是系统测试，也带出课上的问题
Option 2 is the system test, and the lecture's question:

223
00:13:13,852 --> 00:13:16,453
除了我们的代码，还有别的东西能让它失败吗？
can anything but our code make it fail?

224
00:13:16,773 --> 00:13:21,262
在后台启动一个服务器，名字叫 api-server
Start a live server, detached, named api-server,

225
00:13:21,262 --> 00:13:23,600
用 port 9000，DEV 设成 1
on port 9000, with DEV=1.

226
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:26,394
你拿回来的只有一个 container ID
All you get back is a container ID.

227
00:13:26,714 --> 00:13:28,050
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

228
00:13:28,100 --> 00:13:30,425
README 接着马上就跑测试
The README runs the tests immediately.

229
00:13:30,745 --> 00:13:32,204
我们先额外加一步
We add one extra first:

230
00:13:32,204 --> 00:13:35,503
一个循环不停地 curl health 接口，直到它有回应
a loop curling the health endpoint until it answers.

231
00:13:35,823 --> 00:13:39,279
CI 也会等，用它自己的办法；很快你就知道为什么
CI waits too, in its own way; you will see why soon.

232
00:13:39,599 --> 00:13:42,778
第二个额外检查是 docker ps，显示服务器已经起来了
A second extra, docker ps, shows the server up.

233
00:13:43,017 --> 00:13:45,329
现在是 README 里的系统测试命令
Now the README's system command:

234
00:13:45,329 --> 00:13:48,798
docker run 加上 --network host，跑 pytest tests/system/
docker run --network host, pytest tests/system/.

235
00:13:49,118 --> 00:13:52,681
5 passed，这一次请求真的穿过了那根线
5 passed, and this time the request really crossed the wire.

236
00:13:53,001 --> 00:13:54,601
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

237
00:13:55,934 --> 00:13:59,987
来想一个问题：同一条命令再跑一次，但服务器没在运行
Something to ponder: the same command again, with no server running.

238
00:14:00,307 --> 00:14:02,376
这时 pytest 到底会打印什么？
What exactly does pytest print?

239
00:14:11,217 --> 00:14:15,185
README 的下一步正好回答它：停掉并删除服务器
The README's next step answers it: stop and remove the server.

240
00:14:15,505 --> 00:14:18,897
暂停一下，照着做；这次清理顺便就是我们的实验
Pause and do it; the cleanup doubles as our experiment.

241
00:14:19,134 --> 00:14:21,587
答案在这儿，作为额外的一次运行
Here is the answer, as an extra run.

242
00:14:21,907 --> 00:14:25,385
1 passed, 4 skipped，标题行还是绿的
1 passed, 4 skipped, and the headline is still green.

243
00:14:25,705 --> 00:14:27,710
四个灰点，不算失败
Four gray dots, not failures.

244
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:31,803
只有 -ra 的摘要说了实话
Only the summary from -ra tells the truth:

245
00:14:31,803 --> 00:14:35,667
SKIPPED，API not running at localhost:9000
SKIPPED, API not running at localhost:9000.

246
00:14:35,917 --> 00:14:37,382
为什么会跳过？
Why does it skip?

247
00:14:37,432 --> 00:14:41,890
测试文件只探测一次服务器，就在 pytest 收集这个模块的时候
The test file probes the server once, when pytest collects the module.

248
00:14:42,210 --> 00:14:47,672
这一次的结果决定了整个类：服务器晚一秒起来，就已经太晚了
That one answer marks the whole class: a server that comes up a second late is too late.

249
00:14:47,992 --> 00:14:53,837
拔了电池的烟雾报警器永远不会响，但这不等于没有着火
A smoke detector with its battery removed will never beep, and that is not the same as no fire.

250
00:14:54,084 --> 00:14:58,953
在边界图上，有 22 个测试在里面：上一段的 21 个
On the border picture, 22 tests live inside: the 21 from last scene,

251
00:14:58,953 --> 00:15:03,321
加上系统测试目录里那个从来不需要服务器的测试
plus the one system folder test that never needed the server.

252
00:15:03,641 --> 00:15:05,263
这 4 个站在外面
These 4 stand outside.

253
00:15:05,583 --> 00:15:09,425
诚实的办法是用一个 marker，运行时必须特意选中它
The honest remedy is a marker the run must select on purpose;

254
00:15:09,425 --> 00:15:10,823
第二部分会演示
part 2 shows it.

255
00:15:10,873 --> 00:15:14,236
CI 的做法很响亮：它先 curl 服务器
CI's version is loud: it curls the server first,

256
00:15:14,236 --> 00:15:17,529
服务器要是没起来，整个任务直接失败
and if the server is down, the whole job fails.

257
00:15:17,849 --> 00:15:21,819
系统测试这一行写进门禁表，但放在闸机外面
The system row enters the gate table outside the turnstile:

258
00:15:21,819 --> 00:15:24,142
不是每次 commit 都跑，也不是 hermetic 的
not on every commit, not hermetic.

259
00:15:25,183 --> 00:15:26,911
Part 4 装上门禁
Part 4 installs the gate.

260
00:15:27,231 --> 00:15:30,607
在 container 外面执行 pip install pre-commit
Outside the container, pip install pre-commit,

261
00:15:30,607 --> 00:15:32,067
录制时是 4.7.0
4.7.0

262
00:15:32,067 --> 00:15:37,246
然后在 repo 根目录运行 pre-commit install
at the time of recording; then, from the repo root, pre-commit install:

263
00:15:37,246 --> 00:15:39,626
.git 里就多了一个 hook 文件
a hook file now sits in .git.

264
00:15:39,946 --> 00:15:41,433
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

265
00:15:41,483 --> 00:15:44,214
Git 在每次 commit 之前都会运行这个 hook 文件
Git runs that hook file before every commit.

266
00:15:44,534 --> 00:15:47,577
它放在 .git 里，不属于 repo 的内容
It lives in .git, outside the repository:

267
00:15:47,577 --> 00:15:49,803
每个 clone 都要重新安装
every clone installs it again.

268
00:15:50,123 --> 00:15:53,750
它把工作交给 pre-commit，再由 pre-commit 读取 repo 的配置
It hands over to pre-commit, which reads the repo's config.

269
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:59,504
配置里列了九个 hook：七个卫生检查，从空白字符到私钥
The config names nine hooks: seven hygiene guards, from whitespace to private keys.

270
00:15:59,824 --> 00:16:03,210
再加上 black 和 flake8，宽度都是 120
Then black and flake8, both at width 120,

271
00:16:03,210 --> 00:16:08,826
都只看 src 下面的 Python 文件：测试代码从来不做 lint
both seeing only Python files under src: the tests are never linted.

272
00:16:09,066 --> 00:16:11,650
现在照 README 做一次 commit，工作区是干净的
Now the README's commit, on a clean tree.

273
00:16:11,861 --> 00:16:13,283
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

274
00:16:13,333 --> 00:16:16,672
第一次运行会下载每个 hook pin 住的环境
The first run downloads each hook's pinned environment,

275
00:16:16,672 --> 00:16:19,647
录制时还多了一条无害的警告
plus a harmless warning at the time of recording.

276
00:16:19,967 --> 00:16:23,561
接着每个 hook 都显示 Skipped，git 说 nothing to commit
Then every hook says skipped and git says nothing to commit:

277
00:16:23,561 --> 00:16:26,496
hook 只检查暂存的文件，而什么都没暂存
hooks check staged files, and nothing was staged.

278
00:16:26,733 --> 00:16:31,512
想让它们照样跑一遍，就用 pre-commit run --all-files
To exercise them anyway, pre-commit run --all-files.

279
00:16:31,832 --> 00:16:33,254
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

280
00:16:33,304 --> 00:16:36,513
六个 hook 通过，一个没有文件可查
Six hooks pass, one has no files to check,

281
00:16:36,513 --> 00:16:40,409
然后 black 失败：files were modified by this hook
then black fails: files were modified by this hook;

282
00:16:40,409 --> 00:16:42,242
它重新格式化了 utils.py
it reformatted utils.py.

283
00:16:42,562 --> 00:16:44,973
快速想一下：接下来跑 flake8
A quick ponder: flake8 runs next.

284
00:16:45,293 --> 00:16:47,554
它会报出 Part 2 的那两个问题吗？
Does it report part 2's two findings?

285
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:56,825
不会。文件已经被 black 改写过了
No. Black had already rewritten the file,

286
00:16:56,825 --> 00:16:59,091
所以 flake8 看到的是干净的代码，就通过了
so flake8 saw clean code and passed.

287
00:16:59,411 --> 00:17:01,544
这里的 Failed 不代表代码坏了
Failed here does not mean broken;

288
00:17:01,544 --> 00:17:05,874
意思是 hook 改了文件：看一下改动，再重新暂存
it means the hook changed files: look at the change, then re-stage.

289
00:17:06,116 --> 00:17:09,908
两个额外步骤把这个循环走完：git diff 显示改了什么
Two extras close the loop: git diff shows the fix;

290
00:17:09,908 --> 00:17:11,727
git add -u 把它重新暂存
git add -u re-stages it.

291
00:17:12,047 --> 00:17:14,037
再 commit 一次：七个 hook 通过
Commit again: seven hooks pass,

292
00:17:14,037 --> 00:17:17,888
两个没东西可查，一个真正的 commit 进入了历史
two have nothing to check, and a real commit enters history;

293
00:17:17,888 --> 00:17:19,488
暂停一下，把这个循环走一遍
pause and walk the loop.

294
00:17:19,748 --> 00:17:21,475
README 的最后一个变体
The README's last variant,

295
00:17:21,475 --> 00:17:23,334
不带参数的 pre-commit run
plain pre-commit run, checks

296
00:17:23,334 --> 00:17:24,658
只检查暂存的文件
only staged files;

297
00:17:24,658 --> 00:17:26,050
全部跳过
everything skips.

298
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:28,144
最后一个演示，是额外的
A last demo, as an extra:

299
00:17:28,144 --> 00:17:31,169
用 sed 加一个没用到的 import 并暂存
sed adds and stages an unused import;

300
00:17:31,169 --> 00:17:34,847
在 Mac 上，sed -i 后面要跟一对空引号
on a Mac, sed -i needs empty quotes after it.

301
00:17:35,167 --> 00:17:39,053
这次 commit 被拦了两道：black 重新格式化了文件
The commit fails twice: black reformats the file,

302
00:17:39,053 --> 00:17:43,177
flake8 报出 F401，这是任何格式化工具都修不了的
and flake8 reports F401, which no formatter can fix;

303
00:17:43,177 --> 00:17:46,111
git status 确认 commit 没有生成
git status confirms no commit exists.

304
00:17:46,431 --> 00:17:49,033
把文件恢复原样：你的电脑现在会说不了
Restore the file: your machine now says no.

305
00:17:49,353 --> 00:17:51,785
可这个门禁一个测试都没跑过
But this gate never ran a single test.

306
00:17:52,105 --> 00:17:55,604
第二部分会搭一个会跑测试的门禁，再看看连它也会漏掉什么
Part 2 builds one that does, and shows what even it can miss.

307
00:17:56,650 --> 00:17:59,573
第二部分是 Rahul Dave 的客座讲座
Part 2 is the guest lecture, by Rahul Dave.

308
00:17:59,893 --> 00:18:04,736
它围绕一个小型机器学习项目 babykev 搭起同样的门禁
It builds the same gate around a small machine learning project, babykev,

309
00:18:04,736 --> 00:18:09,313
babykev 回答关于奶酪的问题，还会报告自己有多大把握
which answers questions about cheese and reports how confident it is;

310
00:18:09,313 --> 00:18:11,370
纯粹的猜测应该得零分
a pure guess should score zero.

311
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:13,610
直到最后才用到 Docker
No Docker until the very end.

312
00:18:13,930 --> 00:18:20,167
先装两个工具，作为额外步骤：第 2 讲的包管理器 uv
Two tools first, as extras: the package manager uv from lecture 2,

313
00:18:20,167 --> 00:18:26,687
录制时是 0.13.2；还有命令运行器 just，1.59.0
0.13.2 at the time of recording, and the command runner just, 1.59.0.

314
00:18:26,933 --> 00:18:29,339
先 clone babykev，再列出它的 tag
Clone babykev and list its tags:

315
00:18:29,339 --> 00:18:31,669
一共 9 步，课上每个阶段一步
9 steps, one per lecture stage.

316
00:18:31,989 --> 00:18:34,308
这个 repo 本身就是一套幻灯片
The repo is its own slide deck,

317
00:18:34,308 --> 00:18:37,749
用 git switch --detach 就能跳到任意一步
and git switch --detach moves you to any step.

318
00:18:38,069 --> 00:18:39,567
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

319
00:18:39,617 --> 00:18:45,654
在 step-00，一条命令就建好环境：uv sync --locked
At step-00, one command builds the environment: uv sync --locked.

320
00:18:45,974 --> 00:18:52,396
它安装 Python 3.13.16 和项目本身，完全按 lock 文件写的来
It installs Python 3.13.16 and the project exactly as the lockfile says.

321
00:18:52,716 --> 00:18:55,532
加上 --locked，意思是宁可停下，也不悄悄升级
Locked means stop rather than silently upgrade.

322
00:18:55,852 --> 00:18:58,753
录制时它打印的那条警告是无害的
Its warning is harmless, at the time of recording.

323
00:18:59,073 --> 00:19:01,295
前面 cheese 的 repo 冻结的是 image
The cheese repo froze an image;

324
00:19:01,295 --> 00:19:03,123
而 babykev pin 住的是 lock 文件
babykev pins a lockfile.

325
00:19:03,276 --> 00:19:06,002
单独输入 just，会列出所有 recipe
Typing just, alone, lists the recipes:

326
00:19:06,002 --> 00:19:09,590
每个任务一个名字，人、hook，以及之后的 CI 都用它
one name per task, for people, hook, and later CI.

327
00:19:09,910 --> 00:19:11,400
暂停一下，把这些都跑一遍
Pause and run these.

328
00:19:11,450 --> 00:19:14,074
到了 step-01，加进来的是契约和它的测试
Step 1 brings the contract and its tests.

329
00:19:14,394 --> 00:19:19,343
运行 uv run pytest：2 failed, 50 passed，而且测试是对的
Run uv run pytest: 2 failed, 50 passed, and the tests are right.

330
00:19:19,663 --> 00:19:24,091
一个失败是纯粹的猜测被打成了一半的把握
One failure is a pure guess scored as half confident;

331
00:19:24,091 --> 00:19:28,687
另一个是 77 个四舍五入后的概率，加起来只有 0.77
the other is 77 rounded probabilities that sum to 0.77.

332
00:19:29,007 --> 00:19:32,698
和 cheese 的演示同一条规则：改代码，不改测试
Same rule as the cheese demo: fix the code, not the tests.

333
00:19:33,018 --> 00:19:34,367
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

334
00:19:34,417 --> 00:19:36,696
接着 step-02：大规模的格式化和 lint
Step 2 is format and lint at scale,

335
00:19:36,696 --> 00:19:38,296
ruff 一个工具兼两个角色
ruff in both roles.

336
00:19:38,492 --> 00:19:41,500
格式化之后，linter 数出 70 个问题
After formatting, the linter counts 70 findings.

337
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:44,124
安全的自动修复去掉了一个
Safe automatic fixes remove one.

338
00:19:44,444 --> 00:19:48,584
有意识地用上不安全的修复，又去掉 32 个
Unsafe fixes, applied deliberately, remove 32 more;

339
00:19:48,584 --> 00:19:51,100
剩下 37 个，这些得靠人
37 remain; those need a person.

340
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:55,219
第一部分的宽度之争，用一行就解决了
And the width war from part 1 is settled in one line,

341
00:19:55,219 --> 00:19:58,804
line-length 设成 100，在 pyproject.toml 里只写一次
line-length = 100, written once in pyproject.toml;

342
00:19:58,804 --> 00:20:01,958
格式化工具和 linter 都照它来
the formatter and the linter both follow it.

343
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:06,612
到了 step-03，用一个 recipe 装好门禁
Step 3 installs the gate with one recipe,

344
00:20:06,612 --> 00:20:10,179
just setup，同步 lock 文件和安装 hook 一起完成
just setup: lockfile sync and hook install together.

345
00:20:10,499 --> 00:20:11,921
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

346
00:20:11,971 --> 00:20:14,765
按 walk.md，下一条命令打印出这个 hook 文件
The walk's next command prints the hook file:

347
00:20:14,765 --> 00:20:18,243
和前面一样的交接链，只有一处不同
the same hand-over chain as before, with one difference.

348
00:20:18,563 --> 00:20:21,374
里面写死了这台机器自己的 venv 路径
This machine's own venv path is baked inside,

349
00:20:21,374 --> 00:20:22,974
所以它永远不会被 commit
so it is never committed.

350
00:20:23,183 --> 00:20:26,172
这里的配置只有四个 hook，不是九个
The config here has four hooks, not nine:

351
00:20:26,172 --> 00:20:30,912
大文件、合并冲突标记、一个拒绝任何 .env 文件的策略 hook
large files, merge markers, a policy hook refusing any .env file,

352
00:20:30,912 --> 00:20:33,828
还有一个运行 just check 的本地 hook
and one local hook that runs just check.

353
00:20:34,148 --> 00:20:36,431
所以 hook 跑的正是你自己敲的那条命令
So the hook runs exactly what you type.

354
00:20:36,751 --> 00:20:39,670
在这一步，just check 包括格式检查、lint、带
At this step, just check means format check,

355
00:20:39,670 --> 00:20:43,983
90% 覆盖率下限的测试，以及配置文件的 lint
lint, tests with a 90 percent coverage floor, and config linting.

356
00:20:44,483 --> 00:20:48,856
运行 just check：全部是绿的，覆盖率显示 100%
Run just check: everything green, the floor reads 100 percent.

357
00:20:49,176 --> 00:20:53,614
现在看它咬人：只跑 confidence 相关的测试，下限不变
Now watch it bite: ask for only the confidence tests, keeping the floor.

358
00:20:53,934 --> 00:20:57,833
9 个测试通过，一半的代码根本没跑到
9 tests pass, half the code is never exercised,

359
00:20:57,833 --> 00:21:01,400
这次运行以 49.4% 的覆盖率失败
and the run fails at 49.4 percent coverage.

360
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,662
下限是门禁，不是目标
A floor is a gate, not a goal.

361
00:21:03,982 --> 00:21:05,483
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

362
00:21:05,533 --> 00:21:10,034
配置文件也要检查：hook 配置一坏，每次 commit 都会坏
Config files are checked too: a broken hook config breaks every commit.

363
00:21:10,354 --> 00:21:13,172
在 pre-commit 配置里缩进错一处
One wrong indent in the pre-commit config,

364
00:21:13,172 --> 00:21:15,453
yamllint 就会指出具体是哪一行
and yamllint names the exact line.

365
00:21:15,773 --> 00:21:18,266
恢复之后，这个 recipe 跑绿了
Restored, the recipe runs green;

366
00:21:18,266 --> 00:21:22,707
它还会校验 pyproject.toml，检查 lock 文件
it also validates pyproject.toml and checks the lockfile.

367
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:26,534
现在门禁要拒绝了，两次；暂停一下，试试第一次
Now the gate refuses, twice; pause and try the first.

368
00:21:26,854 --> 00:21:28,971
加进一个没用到的 import
An unused import goes in;

369
00:21:28,971 --> 00:21:32,443
commit 在 F401 上失败，没有生成 commit
the commit fails on F401, no commit made.

370
00:21:32,763 --> 00:21:38,065
接着暂存一个 .env 文件，拒绝的理由就是配置里自己写的那句话
Then a .env file is staged, and the refusal is the config's own sentence:

371
00:21:38,065 --> 00:21:42,278
.env 文件装的是一台机器的设置和密钥
a .env file holds the settings and secrets of one machine.

372
00:21:42,598 --> 00:21:44,198
它永远不能 commit
It is never committed.

373
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:48,815
两种门禁风格，都没问题：这个只指出问题，由你来跑 just fmt
Two gate styles, both fine: this one points and you run just fmt;

374
00:21:48,815 --> 00:21:51,803
cheese 的门禁直接改写，再逼你看一眼
the cheese gate rewrites and makes you look.

375
00:21:52,123 --> 00:21:55,789
接下来 step-04 和 step-04b 把文档放进门禁
Steps 4 and 4b put documentation in the gate:

376
00:21:55,789 --> 00:22:01,248
一开始 88 个函数、方法和类里有 50 个带类型标注和文档
first 50 of 88 functions, methods and classes typed and documented,

377
00:22:01,248 --> 00:22:03,204
下一步是 88 个全都有
one step later 88 of 88;

378
00:22:03,204 --> 00:22:06,544
删掉一条说明就会拦下 commit
deleting one description blocks a commit.

379
00:22:06,864 --> 00:22:08,549
表里又多了两行
Two rows join the table.

380
00:22:13,683 --> 00:22:15,782
到了 step-05，模型来了
Step 5 brings the model:

381
00:22:15,782 --> 00:22:23,742
setup 这个 recipe 现在会拉下整套模型依赖，录制时是 38 个包
the setup recipe now pulls the model stack, 38 packages including torch 2.14.1 for the CPU,

382
00:22:23,742 --> 00:22:25,928
包括 CPU 版的 torch 2.14.1
at the time of recording.

383
00:22:26,248 --> 00:22:31,134
然后是 just test：92 passed，覆盖率 94%，全绿
Then just test: 92 passed, coverage 94 percent, all green.

384
00:22:31,454 --> 00:22:33,000
暂停一下，两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

385
00:22:33,050 --> 00:22:34,650
这个模型做什么？
What does the model do?

386
00:22:34,778 --> 00:22:38,917
一个请求把一段状态和几个问题打包进同一个序列
A request packs one state and several questions into one sequence.

387
00:22:39,237 --> 00:22:40,931
有一个 mask 强制执行一条规则
A mask enforces one rule:

388
00:22:40,931 --> 00:22:45,402
一个问题可以看到状态和它自己，绝不能看到兄弟问题
a question may see the state and itself, never a sibling question.

389
00:22:45,722 --> 00:22:50,863
问题必须各自独立回答；偷看一眼，就会把一个答案泄露进另一个
Questions must be answered independently; a peek would leak one answer into another.

390
00:22:51,183 --> 00:22:55,002
这一个禁止的格子，就是它和 causal mask 的全部区别
That one forbidden cell is the whole difference from a causal mask.

391
00:22:56,516 --> 00:22:59,140
按 walk.md 打印出代码构建的 mask
The walk prints the mask the code builds,

392
00:22:59,140 --> 00:23:02,048
两个状态 token，加两个各有两个 token 的问题
for two state tokens and two questions of two;

393
00:23:02,048 --> 00:23:03,648
暂停一下，打印你自己的
pause and print yours.

394
00:23:03,812 --> 00:23:08,740
第 5 行和第 6 行说明，问题 2 什么都能看到，包括问题 1
Rows 5 and 6 say question 2 sees everything, including question 1.

395
00:23:09,060 --> 00:23:10,572
原因只有一行
The cause is one line:

396
00:23:10,572 --> 00:23:14,970
torch 的 ones like 把每一对 token 都标成同一个问题
torch.ones_like marks every pair of tokens as the same question.

397
00:23:15,216 --> 00:23:18,991
一个检查脚本把构建出的 mask 和我们想要的那个对比
A checker script compares the built mask against the one we meant,

398
00:23:18,991 --> 00:23:20,763
在那几行打印出 WRONG
and prints WRONG on those rows.

399
00:23:21,083 --> 00:23:23,298
可是 just check 里没有任何东西会运行它
But nothing in just check runs it;

400
00:23:23,298 --> 00:23:25,968
靠眼睛看的打印结果不是测试
a printout you read by eye is not a test.

401
00:23:26,288 --> 00:23:32,091
来想一个问题：branch mask 的每一行都跑到了，覆盖率显示 94%
Something to ponder: every line of branch_mask ran, and coverage reads 94 percent.

402
00:23:32,411 --> 00:23:34,566
有哪个覆盖率数字能抓到这个 bug 吗？
Can any coverage number catch this bug?

403
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:49,075
不能。覆盖率数的是跑过的行，从不管有没有人检查它们算出了什么
No. Coverage counts lines that ran, never whether anyone checked what they produced.

404
00:23:49,395 --> 00:23:51,549
必要，但永远不充分
Necessary, and never sufficient.

405
00:23:51,783 --> 00:23:54,252
同样绿着却看不见的，还有类型检查器
Also green and blind: the type checker,

406
00:23:54,252 --> 00:23:57,543
它只读声明的类型，不运行代码
which reads declared types without running the code.

407
00:23:57,863 --> 00:24:01,746
运行 ty，发现 6 条诊断，可 just check 还是绿的
Running ty finds 6 diagnostics, yet just check is green:

408
00:24:01,746 --> 00:24:07,015
类型还没进门禁，而门禁之外的检查谁也保护不了
types are not in the gate yet, and a check outside the gate protects nobody.

409
00:24:07,250 --> 00:24:09,691
最后，在真实模型上跑冒烟测试
Last, the smoke on the real model:

410
00:24:09,691 --> 00:24:14,645
5 亿参数，从公开的模型托管平台 Hugging Face Hub 下载一次
half a billion parameters, downloaded once from the Hugging Face Hub,

411
00:24:14,645 --> 00:24:18,529
在 CPU 上回答 15 个奶酪问题
a public model host, answering 15 cheese questions on CPU; pause

412
00:24:18,529 --> 00:24:20,129
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and run it.

413
00:24:20,349 --> 00:24:21,949
15 个里答对了 6 个
6 of 15 right.

414
00:24:22,162 --> 00:24:25,468
什么都没训练，这些都是猜的；先记住这个数字
Nothing is trained, these are guesses; hold that number.

415
00:24:27,117 --> 00:24:29,890
到了 step-05a，用真正能看出问题的测试来回应
Step 5a answers with tests that could tell.

416
00:24:30,210 --> 00:24:31,399
先说实话
First, honesty:

417
00:24:31,399 --> 00:24:35,522
在这台机器上，just test 显示 1 failed, 102 passed
on this machine just test says 1 failed, 102 passed.

418
00:24:35,842 --> 00:24:39,256
失败的那个测试要求输出逐位相同
The failing test demands bit for bit equal outputs.

419
00:24:39,576 --> 00:24:41,076
在这台 Linux 的 CPU 上
On this Linux CPU,

420
00:24:41,076 --> 00:24:45,061
torch 求和的顺序和作者的 Mac 不一样
torch sums in a different order than the author's Mac;

421
00:24:45,061 --> 00:24:48,109
在 Mac 上 103 个全部通过，walk.md 里有记录
there all 103 pass, as the walk records.

422
00:24:48,429 --> 00:24:51,542
所谓 hermetic，是只有你的代码能让它失败
Hermetic means only your code can make it fail;

423
00:24:51,542 --> 00:24:54,986
跨机器逐位一致是一个更强的承诺
bit exactness across machines is a stronger promise;

424
00:24:54,986 --> 00:24:56,642
这台机器把它量了出来
this machine measured it.

425
00:24:56,884 --> 00:24:58,263
现在说正题
Now the lesson.

426
00:24:58,313 --> 00:25:03,284
故意放进一个错的修复：它只挡住紧挨在前面的那个问题
A deliberately wrong fix goes in, one that blocks only the question just before.

427
00:25:03,604 --> 00:25:07,145
6 个 token 的图说一切正常；它看不出来
The six token picture says all ok; it cannot tell.

428
00:25:07,465 --> 00:25:10,964
4 个 token 的图就能：它的最后一行显示 WRONG
A four token picture can: its last row reads WRONG.

429
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:12,971
换个办法：把规则写一次
State the rule once instead.

430
00:25:13,291 --> 00:25:17,760
属性测试让 hypothesis 随便抽请求的形状
The property test lets hypothesis draw any request shape:

431
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:21,995
状态 1 到 6 个 token，最多 4 个问题，每个 1 到 5 个 token
a state of 1 to 6 tokens, up to 4 questions of 1 to 5.

432
00:25:22,315 --> 00:25:27,584
这些尺寸一共允许 4686 种形状，多到没法一张张画图
Those sizes allow 4,686 shapes, too many for pictures.

433
00:25:27,904 --> 00:25:31,061
它断言：任何被允许的一对，都绝不是兄弟问题的一对
It asserts that no allowed pair is ever a sibling pair.

434
00:25:31,381 --> 00:25:33,536
跑之前，先想一个问题
Something to ponder before we run it.

435
00:25:42,384 --> 00:25:44,591
你需要一个往回隔两步的问题
You need a question two steps back,

436
00:25:44,591 --> 00:25:48,187
所以是一个状态 token 加三个各有一个 token 的问题
so one state token and three questions of one token each.

437
00:25:48,507 --> 00:25:50,855
而 hypothesis 自己就找到了
And hypothesis finds it on its own:

438
00:25:50,855 --> 00:25:55,888
这一个测试失败，然后把反例收缩成正好这个形状
the one test fails, then shrinks the counter example to exactly that shape.

439
00:25:56,208 --> 00:25:57,630
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

440
00:25:57,680 --> 00:26:02,074
属性测试不只是说不；它还把最小的证据交到你手上
A property test does not only say no; it hands you the smallest witness.

441
00:26:02,317 --> 00:26:03,429
证明门禁长了牙
Proof the gate

442
00:26:03,429 --> 00:26:07,414
把 step-05 那行错的 mask 放回去，再运行 just test
grew teeth: put step 5's wrong mask line back and run just test;

443
00:26:07,414 --> 00:26:08,923
暂停一下，试一试
pause and try it.

444
00:26:08,973 --> 00:26:13,794
8 failed, 95 passed；之前一路放行的代码，现在被拒绝了
8 failed, 95 passed; code that sailed through before is refused.

445
00:26:14,114 --> 00:26:16,930
门禁只能拒绝它的测试看得见的东西
A gate refuses only what its tests can see.

446
00:26:17,250 --> 00:26:21,709
真正的修复只有一行：同一个问题，意思是同一个 segment ID
The real fix is one line: same question means same segment ID.

447
00:26:21,950 --> 00:26:23,522
类型检查也进了门禁
Types join the gate too:

448
00:26:23,522 --> 00:26:27,454
新的 recipe just types 通过了，check 现在有六行
the new recipe, just types, passes, and check has six lines.

449
00:26:27,774 --> 00:26:29,737
那换上正确的 mask，冒烟测试呢？
And the smoke, with the right mask?

450
00:26:30,057 --> 00:26:32,297
15 个里答对 4 个，比之前还低
4 of 15, lower than before.

451
00:26:32,617 --> 00:26:34,217
暂停一下，跑一下冒烟测试
Pause and run the smoke.

452
00:26:34,451 --> 00:26:37,502
之前的 6 是运气；没训练过的模型，分数说明不了什么
The 6 was luck; an untrained score means nothing.

453
00:26:39,150 --> 00:26:42,563
到了 step-05b，不 hermetic 的测试有了一个诚实的家
Step 5b gives non-hermetic tests an honest home.

454
00:26:42,883 --> 00:26:45,736
新加的真实模型测试标上了 system
A new real model test is marked system,

455
00:26:45,736 --> 00:26:49,246
配置默认把这个 marker 排除在外
and the config deselects that marker by default:

456
00:26:49,246 --> 00:26:52,611
每次 just test 都显示 1 deselected，这是有意的
every just test says 1 deselected, on purpose.

457
00:26:52,850 --> 00:26:57,362
明确要求时，just test -m system 显示 1 passed
Asked for explicitly, just test -m system says 1 passed,

458
00:26:57,362 --> 00:27:02,599
103 deselected：真实模型确实跑了，而且它必须通过，不能跳过
103 deselected: the real model ran, and it had to pass, not skip.

459
00:27:02,919 --> 00:27:05,991
这就是第一部分那次悄悄跳过的诚实版本
That is the honest version of part 1's silent skip.

460
00:27:06,311 --> 00:27:08,018
暂停一下，两种写法都跑一遍
Pause and run both forms.

461
00:27:08,267 --> 00:27:10,040
门禁里又多了几行小的
Smaller rows join the gate:

462
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:12,470
hadolint 对 Dockerfile 做 lint，结果干净
hadolint lints the Dockerfile, clean.

463
00:27:12,790 --> 00:27:16,485
第二部分是在一台没有 Docker 的普通机器上录的
Part 2 was recorded on a plain machine without Docker,

464
00:27:16,485 --> 00:27:18,470
所以这些 recipe 礼貌地失败了
so the recipes fail politely:

465
00:27:18,470 --> 00:27:20,796
docker build 报 command not found
docker build is command not found,

466
00:27:20,796 --> 00:27:23,328
构建 image 的 recipe 也会说明原因
and the image recipe explains itself.

467
00:27:23,648 --> 00:27:26,135
在你装了 Docker Desktop 的笔记本上
On your laptop, with Docker Desktop,

468
00:27:26,135 --> 00:27:28,000
两个 image 都会真正构建出来
both images build for real.

469
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:30,155
剩下的看 walk.md 里的记录
The walk's record shows the rest.

470
00:27:30,475 --> 00:27:35,830
同一个 lock 文件生成两个 image，1.15 GB 和 1.84 GB
Two images from one lockfile, 1.15 and 1.84 gigabytes.

471
00:27:36,150 --> 00:27:40,232
而且 just check 在一个没有网络的 container 里也跑绿了
And just check runs green inside a container with no network:

472
00:27:40,232 --> 00:27:42,976
hermetic 的说法，用实验证明了
the hermetic claim, proved by experiment.

473
00:27:43,217 --> 00:27:47,590
门禁表填满了：六行，系统测试在闸机外面
The gate table is full: six rows, system outside the turnstile.

474
00:27:47,910 --> 00:27:49,268
再说局限
Now the limit.

475
00:27:49,318 --> 00:27:51,270
一个 hook 只在一台机器上运行
A hook runs on one machine,

476
00:27:51,270 --> 00:27:54,886
而 git commit --no-verify 能直接绕过它
and git commit --no-verify walks straight past it.

477
00:27:56,850 --> 00:28:01,635
所以 CI 在一台谁也绕不过的服务器上，把同样的检查再跑一遍
So CI re-runs the same checks on a server nobody can skip:

478
00:28:01,635 --> 00:28:04,935
就是同一个 repo 的 Part 5，第 21 讲
part 5 of this same repo, in lecture 21.

479
00:28:05,255 --> 00:28:06,835
也正因为这样
It is also why the hook,

480
00:28:06,835 --> 00:28:10,126
hook、CI 和 README 应该用同一套写法来写这些检查
CI and the README should spell the checks one way;

481
00:28:10,126 --> 00:28:12,957
cheese 的 repo 还没完全做到
the cheese repo does not quite manage that.

482
00:28:13,277 --> 00:28:16,946
所有人用同一条命令，这是你做 milestone 时要带走的经验
One command for everyone is the lesson for your milestone.

483
00:28:17,266 --> 00:28:21,178
覆盖率下限一句话说完：babykev 选了 90
Coverage floors in one line: babykev chose 90;

484
00:28:21,178 --> 00:28:23,645
milestone 5 要求至少 70
milestone 5 asks at least 70.

485
00:28:25,283 --> 00:28:26,947
回顾之前，先清理
Before the recap, clean up.

486
00:28:27,267 --> 00:28:29,106
README 的 Docker 清理
The README's Docker cleanup:

487
00:28:29,106 --> 00:28:33,176
docker container ls 显示没有在运行的，所以不用停
docker container ls shows nothing running, so nothing to stop.

488
00:28:33,496 --> 00:28:35,934
然后是 docker system prune
Then docker system prune; type y:

489
00:28:35,934 --> 00:28:40,366
输入 y：录制时清掉了大约 95 MB 的构建缓存
about 95 megabytes of build cache, at the time of recording.

490
00:28:40,686 --> 00:28:44,440
最后 docker image ls 显示两个 cheese 的 image
A final docker image ls shows the two cheese images.

491
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:48,067
一个额外步骤把 hook 卸掉：pre-commit uninstall
One extra undoes the hook: pre-commit uninstall.

492
00:28:48,387 --> 00:28:50,870
在 babykev 那边，删掉 venv
On the babykev side, delete the venv;

493
00:28:50,870 --> 00:28:52,548
如果跑过冒烟测试
and if you ran the smoke,

494
00:28:52,548 --> 00:28:56,238
再删掉 Hugging Face 缓存里那个大约 1 GB 的模型
the roughly 1 gigabyte model in the Hugging Face cache.

495
00:28:56,558 --> 00:29:01,400
今天没有任何计费：门禁就在你的笔记本上，这正是重点
Nothing today was billable: the gate lives on your laptop, and that is the point.

496
00:29:01,650 --> 00:29:03,655
五道自测题
5 questions to test yourself.

497
00:29:03,975 --> 00:29:05,714
第一题：逐个文件说说
One: what runs in a unit,

498
00:29:05,714 --> 00:29:09,885
这个 repo 的单元测试、集成测试和系统测试分别运行了什么？
an integration and a system test of this repo, file by file?

499
00:29:10,205 --> 00:29:13,341
第二题：系统测试在完全没有服务器的情况下也通过了
Two: the system tests pass with no server at all.

500
00:29:13,661 --> 00:29:15,585
这时 pytest 实际打印了什么
What does pytest actually print,

501
00:29:15,585 --> 00:29:17,628
这四个测试又是不是 hermetic 的？
and are those four tests hermetic?

502
00:29:17,866 --> 00:29:21,133
第三题：pre-commit install 到底创建了什么
Three: what does pre-commit install actually create,

503
00:29:21,133 --> 00:29:23,519
为什么每个 clone 都要重新运行它？
and why must every clone run it again?

504
00:29:23,839 --> 00:29:26,933
第四题：black 显示 Failed，files were modified
Four: black says failed, files were modified.

505
00:29:27,253 --> 00:29:29,791
你的代码坏了吗，接下来该做什么？
Is your code broken, and what do you do next?

506
00:29:30,111 --> 00:29:34,442
第五题：babykev 有 94% 的覆盖率，mask 却是错的
Five: babykev had 94 percent coverage and a wrong mask.

507
00:29:34,762 --> 00:29:39,136
最后是哪一类测试看到了这个 bug，覆盖率又为什么看不见它？
What kind of test finally saw the bug, and why was coverage blind to it?

508
00:29:39,666 --> 00:29:44,359
答案在练习里，每条命令都在学习指南里
The answers are in the exercises, and every command is in the study guide.

509
00:29:44,679 --> 00:29:47,018
下节课会用到云上的凭据
Next lecture brings cloud credentials,

510
00:29:47,018 --> 00:29:50,034
到时 detect-private-key 这个 hook 就派上用场了
where the detect-private-key hook earns its keep.

511
00:29:50,354 --> 00:29:54,714
到了第 21 讲，这个 repo 的检查会在 GitHub 上运行
And in lecture 21, this very repo's checks run on GitHub,

512
00:29:54,714 --> 00:29:58,461
在那里谁也没法用 --no-verify 绕过去
where nobody can walk past them with --no-verify.
